; A small project plan.
;
; Grammar:
;   title "..."                     an optional title for the report
;   task NAME DURATION [after A, B]  a task, its duration, and what it follows
;
; Blank lines and lines starting with # or ; are ignored.
; Durations are whole units (days, hours, points -- whatever you like).
; `after` lists the tasks that must finish first; a task may name several,
; separated by commas. A duration of 0 is a milestone.

title "Website rebuild"

task brief      2
task design     5 after brief
task copy       4 after brief
task build      8 after design
task integrate  2 after build
task review     3 after integrate, copy
task fix        2 after review
task manual     6 after design
task launch     2 after fix, manual
